{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52450","headline":"回波乐 九十三 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂时自来生，暂时还即死。\n[死]後却还家，生时寄住鬼。\n不愁麦不熟，不怕少谷米。\n佯（张改作「阳」）坡展脚卧，不来（项校「采」）世间事。\n死去长（一作「常」）眠乐，常恐五浊地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}